ke","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-going-mainstream-was-a-mistake.1164077/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240926121547/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-going-mainstream-was-a-mistake.1164077/"},{"title":"psl gods features i also have","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-gods-features-i-also-have.1141006/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241113110605/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-gods-features-i-also-have.1141006/"},{"title":"psl god mindset","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-god-mindset.1129332/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240910065500/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-god-mindset.1129332/"},{"title":"psl needed to wear this","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-needed-to-wear-this.1045857/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240526132246/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-needed-to-wear-this.1045857/"},{"title":"psl scale and height","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scale-and-height.953908/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250312190820/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scale-and-height.953908/"},{"title":"psl scale is flawed at its core women put men into 4 categories and this is the only thing that matters","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scale-is-flawed-at-its-core-women-put-men-into-4-categories-and-this-is-the-only-thing-that-matters.947202/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240317040932/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scale-is-flawed-at-its-core-women-put-men-into-4-categories-and-this-is-the-only-thing-that-matters.947202/"}],"web":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing - Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Looksmaxxing"}]},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["The PSL scale, short for Perceived Sexual Levels, is an informal system for rating male facial attractiveness on roughly a 1 to 8 range. Wikipedia reports it was created on three forums, PUAHate, Sluthate and Lookism.net, whose initials form the acronym; the forums are defunct but the terminology spread to wider social media. [1]","Grokipedia, which is AI-generated, describes the scale as based on harmony, dimorphism, angularity and individual features, and as not scientifically validated. [2] No published study has evaluated the scale itself. [1]"],"infobox":[["Full name","Perceived Sexual Levels"],["Range","About 1 to 8 [1]"],["Origin","PUAHate, Sluthate, Lookism.net forums (2010s) [1]"],["Validation","Not scientifically validated [2]"],["Top tiers","Chadlite, Chad, Gigachad [1][2]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description and tiers","paras":["Wikipedia says the scale was designed to reflect how women perceive men and departs from the conventional out-of-ten rating. Its tiers range from 'subhuman' or sub-3 up to 'giga Chad'. [1] Grokipedia lists below 4 as 'subhuman/truecel', 4.0-5.5 as low to high 'normie', 5.6-6.5 as 'Chadlite', 6.6-7.5 as 'Chad' and 7.6-8 as 'Gigachad', and says most men rate around 3.5-4.5; Wikipedia notes inconsistencies in how its own article describes the tiers. [1][2]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"PSL and appeal","paras":["Looksmax.org users debate how PSL differs from 'appeal'. One thread author says common explanations equate PSL with male-gaze features and appeal with female-gaze harmony and social factors, while noting that long-time members dispute this framing. [3]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Criticism and media coverage","paras":["Wikipedia reports critics describing looksmaxxing as judgmental and linking it to body dysmorphia and suicidal ideation, and a New Yorker writer's objection to tiering people. It also notes that some practitioners report benefits such as improved relationships. [1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found that validate the PSL scale. Research on facial attractiveness exists in the wider psychology literature but does not test this scale. [1]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"PSL is core vocabulary on looksmax.org, where users rate faces and argue over what the scale measures. [3]","claims":[{"claim":"PSL measures facial attractiveness as women perceive it.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"PSL and appeal are different things.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[{"year":"2010s","event":"Scale originates on PUAHate, Sluthate and Lookism.net. [1]"},{"year":"Early 2020s","event":"Terminology spreads to TikTok. [1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Looksmaxxing","source":"Grokipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"PSL and Appeal","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-and-appeal.1816226/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"PSL and Appeal","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-and-appeal.1816226/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260212184857/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-and-appeal.1816226/"},{"title":"PSL and Alt-Right going mainstream makes me feel like I'm living in a simulation","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-and-alt-right-going-mainstream-makes-me-feel-like-im-living-in-a-simulation.1790412/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228201242/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-and-alt-right-going-mainstream-makes-me-feel-like-im-living-in-a-simulation.1790412/"},{"title":"psl scores in la","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scores-in-la.1789625/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228103332/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scores-in-la.1789625/"},{"title":"psl autists will real